ad time reduction (ELTR) {\textgreater} Efficient Customer Response (ECR) {\textgreater}SC visibility, trust \& traceability (SCV\&T). RFID tags enable technology can be more responsive to trust and transparency addition of jewellery organizations. Jewellery managers can be benefits by overcomes of financial losses such as reduction of operational handling cost, misplacement errors reduction and inventory inaccuracy problems etc. Keywords: Supply chain responsiveness, Jewellery SC, ISM, RFID-tags, E-Retail, and ECR.},
